cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SyncAI-Lib-HydraNet: multi-task perception for quadruped robots"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: SYNCROBOTIC
repository-code: "https://github.com/Syncrobotic/SyncAI-Lib-HydraNet"
abstract: >-
  A multi-head perception network for quadruped robots. One shared RegNetX backbone and
  BiFPN neck feed three independent heads in a single forward pass: traversability
  segmentation, terrain classification and anchor-free FCOS object detection. Trained in
  PyTorch under partial supervision across datasets, exported to ONNX for TensorRT on a
  Jetson Orin.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - computer vision
  - multi-task learning
  - semantic segmentation
  - object detection
  - traversability
  - quadruped
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
